{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-07/1058085/block/singleImage/3236486/df/01KXB6EM8392MQB1HDWCXJRQ4Z.JPG?updatedAt=1791813352\"/><figcaption>男子在廁所暈倒，當場不治。</figcaption></figure><p>今日(12日)早上10時許，一名39歲姓鄭男子在藍田麗港城家中廁所內暈倒，家人發現後報警求助。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，消防破門進入，惟經救護員檢驗後，證實男子已經死亡。案件列作「屍體發現」，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T14:21:06.264512+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:55:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T20:38:04.893168+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:18:49.819650+00:00","content_hash":"af3cba23510a8d442de96f0fc26069414ffe5a404de0fff8f56db2626af01b89","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}